splat-sfm-learned
=================

This crate remains Apache-2.0 AND IJG and is excluded from the Vauss
Preview License. The Apache text is in LICENSE-APACHE; JPEG terms are in LICENSE-IJG.txt.

src/model.rs, src/preprocess.rs and the pose conversion in src/lib.rs are a Rust/Burn port of
the camera-pose path of Depth Anything 3 (https://github.com/ByteDance-Seed/Depth-Anything-3,
commit 3d835ec1): the DINOv2 ViT-B backbone with alternating local/global attention, QK-norm,
2D RoPE, reference-view selection and camera tokens, the camera decoder, the pose-encoding
decode, and the input preprocessing.

