The DA3-BASE weights (https://huggingface.co/depth-anything/DA3-BASE, revision f4a6c9b3,
Apache-2.0 per its model card, checked 2026-10-10) are not included; they are read at runtime from the file named by SPLAT_DA3_WEIGHTS, normally
da3-base-cam-f16.safetensors: the backbone and camera-decoder tensors of the upstream
model.safetensors, cast to fp16. Use only Apache-2.0 variants: DA3-LARGE and DA3-GIANT are
CC-BY-NC-4.0 (non-commercial) and must not be substituted.

Changes: only the camera-pose path is ported (no depth/ray/GS heads, no camera encoder); the
model is reimplemented in Burn and the OpenCV/PIL preprocessing is reimplemented in Rust.

src/jpeg.rs follows the algorithms of libjpeg-turbo's jidctint.c, jdsample.c and jdcolor.c
(Independent JPEG Group license; this software is based in part on the work of the Independent
JPEG Group) so that frames decode exactly as PIL decodes them. The upstream copyright notices,
the changes made and the IJG README (copyright and no-warranty notice) are in LICENSE-IJG.txt.
